# Packages fetched by tcz-get.sh, with pinned sha256 checksums.
#
# Each row maps to the release asset (one release per app):
#   https://github.com/sahilnarain/sysinit/releases/download/<name>/<name>-<arch>.tcz
#
# version is a record of what's in that build; only sha256 is enforced.
# Replacing a build means a new sha256 here, so Pis need a git pull afterwards.
#
# arch: aarch64 (64-bit piCore) | armhf (32-bit piCore, must be ARMv6-compatible: Pi Zero W, Pi 1, also ARMv7 boards)
# Add rows with tools/release.sh, which prints the line to paste here.
#
# name    version  arch     sha256
